# Docker build context exclusions.
#
# The context is sent to the daemon in full before any COPY runs, so anything
# listed here never enters a build layer — which is what makes "no secret is
# present in any layer" (FR-042) a property of the build rather than a claim.
#
# This is belt-and-braces with .gitignore, deliberately. .gitignore protects
# what is committed; this protects what is shipped. They are not redundant: a
# developer's uncommitted local .env is in the build context even though it is
# not in the commit.

# --- secrets: never in any layer, committed or not -----------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials.json
service-account*.json

# --- version control -----------------------------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.github

# --- documentation and specs ---------------------------------------------------
# The image serves the API, so it does not carry the specification prose. The
# exception is the gold set's JSON Schema: the evaluation runner validates the
# dataset against it at run time, so the schema is a runtime dependency of the
# evaluation endpoints, not documentation.
specs/**
!specs/001-enterprise-knowledge-rag/contracts/
!specs/001-enterprise-knowledge-rag/contracts/evaluation-dataset.schema.json
docs/
*.md
!README.md

# --- local development ---------------------------------------------------------
**/.venv
venv/
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov
**/*.egg-info

# --- data: the corpus is fetched at run time, never shipped (FR-032) ------------
data/
# `evaluation/` is excluded for everything EXCEPT the curated gold set. The
# exclusion exists so fetched material and local run exports never enter a
# build; `golden_questions.json` is hand-authored, committed, fingerprinted by
# every evaluation run, and must be in the image. A blanket `evaluation/` rule
# is what made every evaluation endpoint 500 inside the container.
evaluation/*
!evaluation/golden_questions.json
crawl-cache/
.raw/
pages/
extracted/
*.html
*.htm
*.pdf

# --- tooling -------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
node_modules/
Makefile
docker-compose*.yml
scripts/
**/playwright-report/
**/test-results/

# --- editors -------------------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
